---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About" description="About StudentKit - the lightweight, fast, and free collection of tools for students.">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mb-8">About StudentKit</h1>
    
    <div class="prose prose-emerald prose-lg text-gray-600">
      <p>
        StudentKit was built with one simple goal: to provide a clean, fast, and completely free collection of everyday tools for college and university students.
      </p>
      
      <p>
        We noticed that most student calculators online are cluttered with intrusive ads, confusing interfaces, or require unnecessary sign-ups. Some even send your data to remote servers just to calculate a simple percentage.
      </p>

      <h2>Our Philosophy</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Always Free:</strong> We will never charge for these basic utilities.</li>
        <li><strong>No Accounts:</strong> You don't need to log in to calculate your GPA or check your attendance.</li>
        <li><strong>Privacy First:</strong> Every tool on this website runs locally in your browser using JavaScript. We do not store your grades, attendance, or personal data on our servers.</li>
        <li><strong>Fast & Minimal:</strong> We don't use bulky frameworks that slow down your device. The site is designed to be lightweight and work perfectly on mobile.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>The Tools</h2>
      <p>
        Whether you need to convert your CGPA to a percentage, find out exactly how many classes you can afford to miss, or just need a minimal Pomodoro timer to focus on your studies, StudentKit has you covered.
      </p>

      <p class="mt-8">
        <a href="/tools" class="text-emerald-600 font-semibold hover:text-emerald-700">Explore all tools &rarr;</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
